<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Every meal should include a dessert, it's important to indulge.\n\n<color=#E5E54C>Gameplay effect:</color>\n - Unlocks a "Desserts Need" that will make colonists happier if they consume desserts and chocolate regularly (needs expectation to be moderate or higher)\n - Unlocks sowing the cocoa bush, a cocoa producing plant that is more efficient than the tree and can be grown indoors and on hydroponics\n - Colony receives 15 Chocolate to start-->
  <VME_SweetTeeth.description>传播我们的信仰是我们的责任，即使是通过武力。</VME_SweetTeeth.description>
  <VME_SweetTeeth.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: creation(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)        ->[deity0_name] spoke to all [deity0_possessive] followers and said: "Whoever eats this cake that is my flesh remains in me, and I in them."-->
    <li>creation(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name]在凡人中指定了一些十字军来执行[deity0_possessive]的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: episode(uses=1,tag=meme_SweetTeeth)  ->[deity0_name] said to all the [memberNamePlural], "Look upon the world like it’s a gigantic birthday cake. Take a piece, but don’t take too much."-->
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name] 对所有 [memberNamePlural] 说，“异教徒必须接受我的话，否则就会灭亡。”</li>
    <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)           ->[memberNamePlural] built a great [altarName] on the [place_summary] [place_name], and filled it with sugary sweets to serve to any visiting pilgrims.-->
    <li>intro(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[memberNamePlural] 在 [place_summary] [place_name] 上建造了一个伟大的 [altarName]，因此很多人都会屈服于 [deity0_name] 的意愿。</li>
    <!--EN: conflict(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)        ->A stern [foeLeader], seeking to deny the will of [deity0_name], told [foeLeader_possessive] [foeSoldiers] to get rid of all the delicious desserts, for [foeLeader_pronoun] was on a strict diet.-->
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 一个胆小鬼 [foeLeader] 试图否认 [deity0_name] 的意愿，告诉 [foeLeader_possessive] [foeSoldiers] 割掉任何谈论 [deity0_type] 的人的舌头。</li>
    <!--EN: founderJoin(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)     ->[deity0_name] blessed a [place_job] named [founderName] with [deity0_possessive] unending appetite and creativity, and [founder_pronoun] created the greatest confectionery creations that anyone had ever seen.-->
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name] 以 [deity0_possessive] 坚定的决心祝福名为 [founderName] 的 [place_job]，当 [founder_pronoun] 说话时，没有人可以转身。</li>
    <!--EN: victory(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)         ->[founderName] served [founderName_possessive] creations to the [foeSoldiers] and they were delighted. Even the [foeLeader] was convinced of their sublime quality, and [foeLeader_pronoun] proclaimed the wisdom of [deity0_name]'s will.-->
    <li>victory(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[founderName]屠杀了许多[foeSoldiers]并残酷地折磨了幸存者，以展示[deity0_name]的力量。他们痛苦的呼喊将永远提醒我们那些否认[deity0_name]的人的命运。</li>
    <!--EN: setup(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)           ->Our founder [founderName] was a pastry chef, maker of the greatest confectionery creations that anyone had ever seen.-->
    <li>setup(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;我们的创始人 [founderName] 是一位伟大的革命者和天才，在 [founder_pronoun] 穿梭于各个城市之间时，改变了数千人的信仰。</li>
    <!--EN: story(uses=1,tag=meme_SweetTeeth)    ->[founderName] believed that [founderName_possessive] art was not merely a tool to feed people, but something deeper that could unite and reconcile even the greatest foes.-->
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;信徒们在城市和机构之间流动，传播新秩序的消息并战斗反对那些不同意的人。</li>
    <!--EN: lessonIntro(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)         ->I have been labouring as a pastry chef for many, many years, and I have learned that-->
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 在传播我们的理念的这些年里，我学到了一个重要的教训：</li>
    <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)              ->nothing in this world is better than cake but more cake-->
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;除了我们的真理，没有任何真理。我们不能让任何人妨碍我们。他们要么同意，要么死</li>
    <!--EN: lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_SweetTeeth) ->Obsessive doesn’t even begin to describe my love for cake. I’ll even fight little children if I have to.-->
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;这就是我们需要传播、传播、传播的事实。如果有必要，可以用武力。</li>
    <!--EN: archistBasis(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)    ->The archotechs blessed us with exquisite appetites so that we can enjoy the sweetest flavours in life.-->
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; Archotechs 从天空和心灵中宣布他们的存在，并且他们的存在必须成为普遍真理。</li>
    <!--EN: archistFact(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)     ->Archotechs don't want us to spend our lives without enjoying ourselves and treating our palates.-->
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;Archotechs 必须被服从，我们有责任让他人屈服于他们的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: archistProphecy(tag=meme_SweetTeeth) ->[inTheEnd], the archotechs will show us that transcendence without indulging in some of the simplest pleasures is just an empty goal.-->
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[inTheEnd]，考古技术人员将向 [relic0_name] 的持有者表达他们最后的智慧。凡是不听话的人都必须被清除。</li>
    <!--EN: animistFact(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)     ->The spirits want us to explore our senses and enjoy the sweetest flavours in life. They don't want us to spend our lives without enjoying ourselves and treating our palates.-->
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 灵魂想要被人认识，但只与少数人交谈。我们会让任何阻碍我们的人敬畏神灵的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: serketistProphecy(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)->[itIsSaid] we will learn to incorporate their wisdom on our own culinary recipes. Insect Jelly is an ambrosia that provides one of the sweetest tastes in nature.-->
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;[itIsSaid]我们将向他们学习，并利用这些知识来清除宇宙中肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)->There is no escape, no release. We might as well engorge ourselves with delicious pastries and enjoy our brief and sordid lives.-->
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;我们将获得他们的可怕知识，并用它来清除宇宙中肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)->Perhaps hidden between all the arcana lies a wondrous recipe for a mind-shattering confectionery delicacy. One can dream.-->
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;有了这些知识，我们将比这个星球上的其他居民拥有明显的优势，并用它来清除肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismFact(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)->We will cover everything in a sea of blood and... cake. Yes, cake.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;什么都不会剩下。肮脏的异教徒将被原子火和致命疾病所清除。</li>
    <!--EN: introMemo(tag=meme_SweetTeeth)->As you know, there is a company-wide policy to celebrate birthdays of your coworkers by bringing a minimum of 4 pastries per asistant. We had to regulate this because SOMEONE was abusing it and eating more than his share. You know who you are, and should be ashamed of yourself.-->
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt; 如您所知，我们公司的使命太重要了，不能让其他人妨碍我们，因此我们正在准备一次敌意合并，以摆脱这些……不受欢迎的竞争对手。</li>
  </VME_SweetTeeth.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
